FORMAT: 1A
HOST: http://rmarchiv.de/api/v3

# rmarchiv API v3

This API provides access to games, screenshots, gamefiles (download links),
ratings, and savegames. Authentication uses a Bearer token obtained via login.

## Authentication [/auth/login]

### Login [POST]

+ Request (application/json)

        {
            "email": "user@example.com",
            "password": "your password"
        }

+ Response 200 (application/json)

        {
            "status_code": 200,
            "message": "Login successful",
            "data": {
                "token": "plain-api-token",
                "token_type": "Bearer"
            }
        }

## Games [/games{?per_page}]

### List games [GET]

+ Parameters
    + per_page: 50 (number, optional) - Items per page (1-200).

+ Response 200 (application/json)

        {
            "status_code": 200,
            "message": "List of games",
            "data": [
                {
                    "id": 1,
                    "title": "Game Title",
                    "subtitle": "Subtitle",
                    "release_date": "2003-04-15",
                    "maker": {
                        "id": 1,
                        "title": "RPG Maker 2003",
                        "short": "2k3"
                    },
                    "language": {
                        "id": 1,
                        "name": "Deutsch",
                        "short": "de"
                    },
                    "votes": {
                        "up": 12,
                        "down": 3,
                        "avg": 0.6
                    }
                }
            ],
            "meta": {
                "page": 1,
                "per_page": 50,
                "total": 1234,
                "last_page": 25
            }
        }

## Game Search [/games/search{?q,per_page}]

### Search games [GET]

+ Parameters
    + q: "vampire" (string, required) - Search query (title/subtitle).
    + per_page: 50 (number, optional) - Items per page (1-200).

+ Response 200 (application/json)

        {
            "status_code": 200,
            "message": "Search results",
            "data": [
                {
                    "id": 1,
                    "title": "Vampire Story",
                    "subtitle": "Chapter 1",
                    "release_date": "2003-04-15",
                    "maker": {
                        "id": 1,
                        "title": "RPG Maker 2003",
                        "short": "2k3"
                    },
                    "language": {
                        "id": 1,
                        "name": "Deutsch",
                        "short": "de"
                    },
                    "votes": {
                        "up": 12,
                        "down": 3,
                        "avg": 0.6
                    }
                }
            ],
            "meta": {
                "query": "vampire",
                "page": 1,
                "per_page": 50,
                "total": 12,
                "last_page": 1
            }
        }

## Game Details [/games/{id}]

### Get game details [GET]

+ Parameters
    + id: 1 (number, required) - Game ID.

+ Response 200 (application/json)

        {
            "status_code": 200,
            "message": "Game details",
            "data": {
                "id": 1,
                "title": "Game Title",
                "subtitle": "Subtitle",
                "release_date": "2003-04-15",
                "description_md": "Markdown text",
                "description_html": "<p>HTML text</p>",
                "website_url": "https://example.com",
                "youtube": "https://youtube.com/...",
                "maker": {
                    "id": 1,
                    "title": "RPG Maker 2003",
                    "short": "2k3"
                },
                "language": {
                    "id": 1,
                    "name": "Deutsch",
                    "short": "de"
                },
                "developers": [
                    { "id": 10, "name": "Developer A" }
                ],
                "tags": [
                    { "id": 5, "title": "Horror" }
                ],
                "votes": {
                    "up": 12,
                    "down": 3,
                    "avg": 0.6
                },
                "screenshots": [
                    {
                        "id": 99,
                        "screenshot_id": 1,
                        "url": "http://rmarchiv.de/games/1/screenshot/show/1",
                        "full_url": "http://rmarchiv.de/games/1/screenshot/show/1/full"
                    }
                ],
                "gamefiles": [
                    {
                        "id": 200,
                        "release_type": { "id": 3, "title": "Vollversion" },
                        "release_version": "1.0",
                        "release_date": "2003-04-15",
                        "filesize": 12345678,
                        "extension": "zip",
                        "language": { "id": 1, "name": "Deutsch", "short": "de" },
                        "download_url": "http://rmarchiv.de/games/download/200/1700000000"
                    }
                ]
            }
        }

## Screenshots [/games/{id}/screenshots]

### List screenshots [GET]

+ Parameters
    + id: 1 (number, required) - Game ID.

+ Response 200 (application/json)

        {
            "status_code": 200,
            "message": "Screenshots",
            "data": [
                {
                    "id": 99,
                    "screenshot_id": 1,
                    "url": "http://rmarchiv.de/games/1/screenshot/show/1",
                    "full_url": "http://rmarchiv.de/games/1/screenshot/show/1/full"
                }
            ]
        }

## Gamefiles [/games/{id}/gamefiles]

### List gamefiles [GET]

+ Parameters
    + id: 1 (number, required) - Game ID.

+ Response 200 (application/json)

        {
            "status_code": 200,
            "message": "Gamefiles",
            "data": [
                {
                    "id": 200,
                    "release_type": { "id": 3, "title": "Vollversion" },
                    "release_version": "1.0",
                    "release_date": "2003-04-15",
                    "filesize": 12345678,
                    "extension": "zip",
                    "language": { "id": 1, "name": "Deutsch", "short": "de" },
                    "download_url": "http://rmarchiv.de/games/download/200/1700000000"
                }
            ]
        }

## Ratings [/games/{id}/ratings]

### Submit rating [POST]

Auth required (Bearer token).

+ Parameters
    + id: 1 (number, required) - Game ID.

+ Request (application/json)

        {
            "rating": "up",
            "comment": "Great game!"
        }

+ Response 201 (application/json)

        {
            "status_code": 201,
            "message": "Rating submitted",
            "data": {
                "game_id": 1,
                "rating": "up",
                "votes": {
                    "up": 13,
                    "down": 3,
                    "avg": 0.62
                }
            }
        }

## Savegames [/gamefiles/{gamefileId}/savegames]

### Get savegames [GET]

Auth required (Bearer token).

+ Parameters
    + gamefileId: 200 (number, required) - Gamefile ID.

+ Response 200 (application/json)

        {
            "status_code": 200,
            "message": "Savegames",
            "data": {
                "0": "BASE64_SAVE_DATA",
                "1": "BASE64_SAVE_DATA"
            }
        }

### Store savegames (multiple) [PUT]

Auth required (Bearer token).

+ Parameters
    + gamefileId: 200 (number, required) - Gamefile ID.

+ Request (application/json)

        {
            "slots": {
                "0": "BASE64_SAVE_DATA",
                "1": "BASE64_SAVE_DATA"
            }
        }

+ Response 200 (application/json)

        {
            "status_code": 200,
            "message": "Savegames stored",
            "data": {
                "saved": 2
            }
        }

## Savegame Slot [/gamefiles/{gamefileId}/savegames/{slotId}]

### Store savegame (single slot) [PUT]

Auth required (Bearer token).

+ Parameters
    + gamefileId: 200 (number, required) - Gamefile ID.
    + slotId: 0 (number, required) - Slot ID.

+ Request (application/json)

        {
            "save_data": "BASE64_SAVE_DATA"
        }

+ Response 200 (application/json)

        {
            "status_code": 200,
            "message": "Savegame stored",
            "data": {
                "slot_id": 0
            }
        }

## Users [/users{?per_page}]

### List users [GET]

+ Parameters
    + per_page: 50 (number, optional) - Items per page (1-200).

+ Response 200 (application/json)

        {
            "status_code": 200,
            "message": "Users",
            "data": [
                { "id": 1, "name": "User", "created_at": "2024-01-01 12:00:00" }
            ],
            "meta": { "page": 1, "per_page": 50, "total": 100, "last_page": 2 }
        }

## User Details [/users/{id}]

### Get user [GET]

+ Parameters
    + id: 1 (number, required) - User ID.

+ Response 200 (application/json)

        {
            "status_code": 200,
            "message": "User",
            "data": { "id": 1, "name": "User", "created_at": "2024-01-01 12:00:00" }
        }

## Current User [/users/me]

### Get current user [GET]

Auth required (Bearer token).

+ Response 200 (application/json)

        {
            "status_code": 200,
            "message": "Current user",
            "data": { "id": 1, "name": "User", "email": "user@example.com", "created_at": "2024-01-01 12:00:00" }
        }

## User Downloads [/users/me/downloads{?per_page}]

### Get download log [GET]

Auth required (Bearer token).

+ Response 200 (application/json)

        {
            "status_code": 200,
            "message": "Download log",
            "data": [
                { "id": 1, "user_id": 1, "gamefile_id": 200, "created_at": "2024-01-01 12:00:00" }
            ],
            "meta": { "page": 1, "per_page": 50, "total": 10, "last_page": 1 }
        }

## Online Users [/users/online]

### Get online users [GET]

+ Response 200 (application/json)

        {
