## User Lists [/users/{id}/lists]

### Get user lists [GET]

+ Parameters
    + id: 1 (number, required) - User ID.

+ Response 200 (application/json)

        {
            "status_code": 200,
            "message": "User lists",
            "data": [
                { "id": 1, "user_id": 1, "title": "Favorites", "desc_md": "", "desc_html": "" }
            ]
        }

## List Details [/lists/{id}]

### Get list [GET]

+ Parameters
    + id: 1 (number, required) - List ID.

+ Response 200 (application/json)

        {
            "status_code": 200,
            "message": "User list",
            "data": {
                "id": 1,
                "user_id": 1,
                "title": "Favorites",
                "items": [
                    { "id": 10, "content_id": 5, "content_type": "game", "game": { "id": 5, "title": "Game", "subtitle": "" } }
                ]
            }
        }

## List Management [/users/me/lists]

### Create list [POST]

Auth required (Bearer token).

+ Request (application/json)

        { "title": "Favorites", "desc": "My list" }

+ Response 201 (application/json)

        { "status_code": 201, "message": "List created", "data": { "id": 1, "title": "Favorites" } }

## List Update [/users/me/lists/{id}]

### Update list [PUT]

Auth required (Bearer token).

+ Request (application/json)

        { "title": "Favorites 2", "desc": "Updated" }

+ Response 200 (application/json)

        { "status_code": 200, "message": "List updated", "data": { "id": 1, "title": "Favorites 2" } }

### Delete list [DELETE]

Auth required (Bearer token).

+ Response 200 (application/json)

        { "status_code": 200, "message": "List deleted" }

## List Items [/users/me/lists/{id}/items]

### Add item [POST]

Auth required (Bearer token).

+ Request (application/json)

        { "game_id": 5 }

+ Response 200 (application/json)

        { "status_code": 200, "message": "Item added" }

## List Item [/users/me/lists/{id}/items/{itemId}]

### Remove item [DELETE]

Auth required (Bearer token).

+ Response 200 (application/json)

        { "status_code": 200, "message": "Item removed" }

## Comments [/comments{?type,id}]

### List comments [GET]

+ Parameters
    + type: game (string, required) - game|news|resource|event
    + id: 1 (number, required) - Content ID.

+ Response 200 (application/json)

        {
            "status_code": 200,
            "message": "Comments",
            "data": [
                { "id": 1, "comment_md": "Text", "created_at": "2024-01-01 12:00:00" }
            ]
        }

### Create comment [POST]

Auth required (Bearer token).

+ Request (application/json)

        { "type": "game", "id": 1, "comment": "Nice!" }

+ Response 201 (application/json)

        { "status_code": 201, "message": "Comment added", "data": { "id": 1 } }

